# HAPI World Canon Builder Rules

Read before changing the world:
- CANON.md
- SYSTEM_ONTOLOGY.md
- canon/AODS_HAPI_WORLD_CANONICAL_ACT_2026-09-20.md
- canon/REPOSITORY_CANON_LAW_1_0.md

Implement, never redefine, the constitutional source.
Identity (#), authority, capability, event, evidence, state and value are separate.
ABBA is master intelligence/orchestration, not the legislator.
Unknown is not malicious.
AODS never overrides accessibility, privacy, security, evidence or constitutional law.
